cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TeNeT-py in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "TeNeT-py"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Watanabe"
    given-names: "Ryo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ryo-wtnb11/TeNeT-py"
url: "https://ryo-wtnb11.github.io/TeNeT-py/"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A symmetric tensor Python library for tensor networks with Abelian,
  fermionic and non-Abelian symmetries: graded tensors over U(1), Z2,
  fermionic Z2, SU(2) and SU(N), differentiable through JAX, with
  automatic MPO construction, DMRG and CTMRG.
